  "description": "This no-bake pudding, flavored with black sesame seeds and honey, is a perfect, elegant warm-weather dessert. Its texture is similar to panna cotta, except that it's slightly less jiggly and a little bit more creamy.",
  "notes": "Total time, including resting: 2 hr 15 min.\n\nOptional substitutions: toasted black sesame seeds → 3 tbsp black sesame seed paste\n\nNotes: If you choose to go the pre-ground sesame paste route, it can be found in jars and squeezable tubes at Japanese supermarkets.",
